{
    "title": "Baby Panda's Breakfast Cooking",
    "description": "In this cooking game, you will prepare delicious breakfasts for your customers in a virtual kitchen! It's time for breakfast now. Come and serve food to your customers!\r\n\r\nFRESH INGREDIENTS\r\nIn order to provide our customers with delicious breakfasts, we have prepared a lot of fresh ingredients such as eggs, milk, potatoes and chicken. Ask your customers what they want and use these ingredients to create a satisfying breakfast for them!\r\n\r\nDELICIOUS BREAKFAST\r\nLet's cook, chef! Make a three-layer muffin, squeeze a cup of colorful juice, or make a golden chicken roll. Just follow the steps in the recipe and you'll cook the most delicious breakfast for your customers!\r\n\r\nKITCHEN TOOLS\r\nWith tons of realistic kitchen tools, such as ovens, juicers, frying pans and pastry bags, you can experience a real cooking process as you chop, stir and fry ingredients in this virtual kitchen.\r\n\r\nThis is a fun cooking game designed for kids! Come and cook delicious breakfasts now!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- Play as a chef and have fun;\r\n- A realistic cooking simulator game;\r\n- 10+ breakfast options: chicken rolls, ham, coffee, egg tarts and more;\r\n- 30+ ingredients: eggs, bread, milk, potatoes and many more!",
    "descriptionHTML": "In this cooking game, you will prepare delicious breakfasts for your customers in a virtual kitchen! It&#39;s time for breakfast now. Come and serve food to your customers!<br><br>FRESH INGREDIENTS<br>In order to provide our customers with delicious breakfasts, we have prepared a lot of fresh ingredients such as eggs, milk, potatoes and chicken. Ask your customers what they want and use these ingredients to create a satisfying breakfast for them!<br><br>DELICIOUS BREAKFAST<br>Let&#39;s cook, chef! Make a three-layer muffin, squeeze a cup of colorful juice, or make a golden chicken roll. Just follow the steps in the recipe and you&#39;ll cook the most delicious breakfast for your customers!<br><br>KITCHEN TOOLS<br>With tons of realistic kitchen tools, such as ovens, juicers, frying pans and pastry bags, you can experience a real cooking process as you chop, stir and fry ingredients in this virtual kitchen.<br><br>This is a fun cooking game designed for kids! Come and cook delicious breakfasts now!<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- Play as a chef and have fun;<br>- A realistic cooking simulator game;<br>- 10+ breakfast options: chicken rolls, ham, coffee, egg tarts and more;<br>- 30+ ingredients: eggs, bread, milk, potatoes and many more!",
